      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY HEIGHTY (8) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (26.06) at this track. Form at the trip sound including six wins. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Must come into calculations. SHADY LADY (4) charged out of the boxes with a strong early split and went straight to the front, scoring an all the way win (25.94) over 460m at this track. Should be in this for a long way. AMRON SAMMY (2) has mixed form recently, finishing seventh (29.14) in a Grade 5 at Sale latest but did run well two back when in the frame. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. TO PERU (1) is worth including.",
